{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mission on the planet is a 3D platform game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A robot called Martin X arrives to the planet Tellus with his spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He has a mission: aliens have kidnaped doctor Hugo and Martin has to rescue him.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player has to find, where aliens keep doctor Hugo and on the way to him player has to eliminate obstacles and enemies like warriors, aliens, spiders, ufos, dragons and zombies etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player moves robot with keyboard and shoots with mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player can rotate camera view and zoom camera in/out.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3786570?t=1751880895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786570/8970a0bccdb9628238230d32f850b7f06eef8056/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751880895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786570/d9a6d24e42779046f1e269299d954189b3455c6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751880895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786570/d9a6d24e42779046f1e269299d954189b3455c6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751880895","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mission on the planet is a 3D platform game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A robot called Martin X arrives to the planet Tellus with his spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He has a mission: aliens have kidnaped doctor Hugo and Martin has to rescue him.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player has to find, where aliens keep doctor Hugo and on the way to him player has to eliminate obstacles and enemies like warriors, aliens, spiders, ufos, dragons and zombies etc.</p><p class=\"bb_pa